{
  "tema": 5220,
  "slug": "hubo-un-accidente",
  "titulo": "There was, there were: hubo",
  "subtitulo": "Ayer hubo un accidente en la garita.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "Hubo is the preterite of hay: there was / there were for an event that happened and finished (an accident, a party, a storm, a problem). It never changes: hubo un problema, hubo muchos problemas.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hubo** = _there was / there were_, for **events** that happened at a point in the past."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "hubo",
            "+",
            "event (singular or plural)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hubo** never goes plural: **hubo dos accidentes**. **Hubieron** is a common mistake."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Typical nouns: **un accidente, una fiesta, un temblor, una tormenta, un problema, un concierto, una pelea**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It often comes with a time: **ayer**, **anoche**, **el sábado**, **en 2010**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To describe a scene (what was there), use **había**: _Había mucha gente._ To report an event, use **hubo**: _Hubo una fiesta._"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: if you can add _happened_ in English (_there was an accident, it happened_), use **hubo**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Anoche ==hubo== un temblor.",
              "en": "There was an earthquake last night."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ayer ==hubo== un accidente en la garita.",
              "en": "There was an accident at the border crossing yesterday."
            },
            {
              "es": "El sábado ==hubo== una fiesta en la playa.",
              "en": "There was a party on the beach on Saturday."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hubo== dos peleas en el torneo.",
              "en": "There were two fights in the tournament."
            },
            {
              "es": "En 2010 ==hubo== un terremoto en Mexicali.",
              "en": "In 2010 there was an earthquake in Mexicali."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Hubo== algún problema con el pedido?",
              "en": "Was there any problem with the order?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hubo== mucho tráfico esta mañana.",
              "en": "There was a lot of traffic this morning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
